{"seq":1,"slug":"reputation-values","title":"声望数值与阈值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-faction-reputation-systems/mechanics/reputation-values","wordCount":1532,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"声望数值与阈值\">声望数值与阈值</h1><p>《魔兽世界》把一个阵营的声望切成「仇恨、敌对、冷淡、中立、友好、尊敬、崇敬、崇拜」八段，每段之间隔着一道明确的分值门槛；跨过「友好」你才能用它的坐骑，跨过「崇敬」才解锁专属装备。这套「连续分值 + 离散段位」的双层结构，是几乎所有声望系统的数值骨架。本篇是全 hub 的数值主篇：讲清声望怎么存、怎么分级、怎么增长与衰减、以及为什么钳制和双向计数如此重要。后面凡涉及分值、阈值、衰减的地方都回指这里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-连续分值与离散段位的双层结构\">核心概念：连续分值与离散段位的双层结构</h2><p>声望在内部是一个连续（或细粒度整数）的分值，但玩家和游戏逻辑关心的往往是它落在哪个<strong>段位</strong>。系统因此维护两层：底层是精确分值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>，上层是由一组阈值把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 切成的若干态度段。这种设计让数值调优（改分值）与内容设计（挂在段位上）解耦——策划可以微调玩家升到「友好」需要多少分，而不必改动「友好」段位触发的所有内容。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[行为产生增量 Δr] --&gt; B[累加到分值 r]&#10;  B --&gt; C[钳制到 rmin..rmax]&#10;  C --&gt; D[查阈值表&lt;br/&gt;r 落在哪一段]&#10;  D --&gt; E[输出当前段位&lt;br/&gt;敌对/中立/友好...]&#10;  E --&gt; F[段位驱动后果与态度]&#10;  B --&gt; G[随时间衰减&lt;br/&gt;向中性回归]&#10;  G --&gt; B\">flowchart TD\n  A[行为产生增量 Δr] --&gt; B[累加到分值 r]\n  B --&gt; C[钳制到 rmin..rmax]\n  C --&gt; D[查阈值表&lt;br/&gt;r 落在哪一段]\n  D --&gt; E[输出当前段位&lt;br/&gt;敌对/中立/友好...]\n  E --&gt; F[段位驱动后果与态度]\n  B --&gt; G[随时间衰减&lt;br/&gt;向中性回归]\n  G --&gt; B</pre><h2 id=\"取值区间与钳制\">取值区间与钳制</h2><p>第一个决策是分值的定义域。常见有两类：以 0 为中性、向正负两端延展的对称区间（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>100</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>100</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[-100, +100]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，适合单轴道德光谱），或从 0 起、只增不减到上限的单向区间（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>42000</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0, 42000]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">42000</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，适合「刷声望」式进度）。无论哪种，<strong>钳制（clamp）</strong> 都不可省——增量累加后必须夹回合法区间：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r&#x27; = \\max(r_{\\min}, \\min(r_{\\max}, r + \\Delta r))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>不钳制会带来两类事故：数值溢出，以及「无限刷」——如果满声望后行为仍在累加，玩家会发现某些重复动作能把分值堆到荒谬的高度，破坏后续所有阈值判定。钳制还隐含一个设计后果：当玩家已在上限，继续做好事没有数值回报，此时要靠别的激励（内容、装备）维持动力，否则玩家会觉得「刷满了就没意义了」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"段位阈值设计\">段位阈值设计</h2><p>阈值表把连续分值切成离散态度。设计阈值时有几条经验：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>段位</th>\n<th>示例分值区间</th>\n<th>典型语义</th>\n<th>触发的后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>敌对</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>100</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>50</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[-100, -50)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>见面攻击</td>\n<td>死亡小队、禁止进入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冷淡</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>50</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[-50, -10)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>不信任</td>\n<td>涨价、拒绝服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中立</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[-10, +10]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>陌生人</td>\n<td>常规价格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>友好</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>50</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(+10, +50]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>认可</td>\n<td>折扣、开放任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>崇敬</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>50</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>100</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(+50, +100]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>盟友</td>\n<td>专属装备、据点通行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>几个要点：段位数量宜精不宜多，玩家能感知的差异有限，八段已接近上限；<strong>相邻段位的分值间隔可以不等宽</strong>——把「中立→友好」设窄让早期进展快、有正反馈，把「崇敬」设宽让顶级声望显得珍贵；此外，跨越段位时应给玩家明确信号（见 <a href=\"../expression/reputation-feedback\">声望反馈与 UI</a>），因为段位切换才是玩家真正感知到的「事件」。段位一旦确定，NPC 的态度状态机就挂在它上面，映射细节见 <a href=\"../expression/npc-attitude\">NPC 态度与反应</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"增益函数与目击放大\">增益函数与目击放大</h2><p>声望不是「做了就 +1」这么线性。成熟系统会让单次增量随情境浮动。一次行为的原始增量常写成基础值乘上若干情境系数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>witness</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>timing</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>magnitude</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta r = \\Delta_{\\text{base}} \\cdot m_{\\text{witness}} \\cdot m_{\\text{timing}} \\cdot m_{\\text{magnitude}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">witness</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7306em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">timing</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">magnitude</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>witness</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{\\text{witness}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">witness</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是目击放大——被多名该阵营成员目睹的行为，影响更大（业界常用 1.5 倍左右）；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>timing</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{\\text{timing}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">timing</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是时机系数，剧情关键时刻的抉择可能翻倍；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>magnitude</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{\\text{magnitude}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">magnitude</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 反映行为本身的量级（偷一枚硬币 vs 洗劫金库）。这些系数把「同一动作在不同情境下意义不同」编码进了数值，本身属于行为侧的设计，完整讨论见 <a href=\"actions-consequences\">行为与后果</a>。数值篇只负责保证：这些系数算出的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 最终被正确累加并钳制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"衰减与双向计数\">衰减与双向计数</h2><p><strong>衰减（decay）</strong> 让声望随时间向中性回归，模拟「世界会淡忘」。常见做法是每隔一段游戏时间对偏离中性的分值做指数衰减：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{t+1} = r_c + (r_t - r_c) \\cdot e^{-\\lambda \\Delta t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是中性值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是衰减速率。衰减有利有弊：它给「洗白」提供了自然通道，避免一次失误永久锁死玩家（这与 <a href=\"../practice/balancing-reputation\">平衡与调校</a> 里反复强调的「留退路」直接相关）；但衰减太快会让玩家觉得「努力白费」，太慢则形同没有。许多游戏干脆对恶名不衰减、只让名声缓慢衰减，以体现「坏名声更难摆脱」。</p>\n<p><strong>双向计数</strong>是另一个关键决策。如前一章 <a href=\"../foundations/reputation-models\">声望模型</a> 所述，双轴模型用独立的 Fame 与 Infamy 而非单一标量。在数值实现上，这意味着一个阵营挂两个计数器，各自钳制、各自衰减，最终态度由二者共同查表决定。双向计数的好处是保留了行为历史的两面——你做过的善与恶不会在数值上被抵消抹平，这对表达「复杂人格」至关重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>声望的数值骨架是「连续分值 + 离散段位」双层结构，让数值调优与内容设计解耦。</li>\n<li>钳制不可省，它防溢出、防无限刷；段位阈值宜精不宜多、可不等宽，早期设窄给正反馈、顶段设宽显珍贵。</li>\n<li>单次增量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 随目击人数、时机、行为量级等系数浮动，编码「同一动作情境不同意义不同」。</li>\n<li>衰减让世界淡忘、给洗白通道，但速率要慎调；恶名常设为不衰减或慢衰减。</li>\n<li>双向计数（Fame/Infamy 分账）保留善恶两面，各自钳制与衰减，共同决定态度。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章·增量系数的行为侧设计：<a href=\"actions-consequences\">行为与后果</a>。</li>\n<li>段位如何驱动个体反应：<a href=\"../expression/npc-attitude\">NPC 态度与反应</a>。</li>\n<li>模型基础：<a href=\"../foundations/reputation-models\">声望模型</a>。</li>\n<li>跨库·数值曲线与钳制的通用手法：<a href=\"../../game-economy-balancing/foundations/number-systems-curves\">数值系统与曲线</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"声望数值与阈值","id":"声望数值与阈值"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：连续分值与离散段位的双层结构","id":"核心概念-连续分值与离散段位的双层结构"},{"level":2,"text":"取值区间与钳制","id":"取值区间与钳制"},{"level":2,"text":"段位阈值设计","id":"段位阈值设计"},{"level":2,"text":"增益函数与目击放大","id":"增益函数与目击放大"},{"level":2,"text":"衰减与双向计数","id":"衰减与双向计数"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"阵营类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-faction-reputation-systems/foundations/faction-types"},"next":{"title":"阵营关系图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-faction-reputation-systems/mechanics/faction-relationships"}}